+## [2026-11-08] review | Prompted quote-to-chat integration repair
+
+Independent acceptance reported a quote label constrained by global icon-button sizing and a caret/focus failure after insertion. This prompted repair gives the action content-sized dimensions and defers composer focus/caret persistence until React commits the draft and the reader clears its selection. An isolated built-app Chromium regression checks label/viewport geometry, pointer/Enter/Space activation, dismissal, attribution, end-caret stability, continued typing, draft persistence, and no automatic send at desktop and narrow widths. Normal checks, tests, and build pass. This is repair evidence, not a fresh uncoached transfer or independent acceptance; live providers and native dialogs were not exercised.
